Package: pve-smart-alert
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), perl, smartmontools (>= 7.0), libpve-notify-perl, ${misc:Depends}
Description: SMART drive alerts for Proxmox VE
 PVE SMART Alert reads the SMART data of all drives of a Proxmox VE host at
 regular intervals, evaluates it against thresholds that predict failure, and
 reports a problem through the Proxmox VE notification system with a real
 severity.
 .
 A notification goes through the notification system, which is where the
 targets and matchers configured for the host decide where it ends up. When
 that route is broken, the message is sent as mail to root instead, so that a
 broken route cannot silence the tool.
 .
 The tool changes nothing on the host except its own files, and it only reads
 from the drives.
 .
 This is an independent project. It is not affiliated with Proxmox Server
 Solutions GmbH.
